post-it: Can't open images
symptoms:
	Can't open pictures
		shows: opening a picture says "Cannot find the file 'C:\WINDOWS\PBRUSH.EXE' (or one of its components)"
	Programs won't start
		shows: Notepad, WordPad, Paint, Calculator and more don't run
checks:
	Programs in C:\WINDOWS start
		shows: NOTEPAD, WORDPAD, PBRUSH, CALC and others lost their .EXE
software steps:
	Open C:\WINDOWS
	Rename each program that lost its .EXE back to its name with .EXE
